{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census","id":1397629,"title":"\u200bA Terrestrial Census","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-19T23:23:04-07:00","id":1397629,"title":"\u200bA Terrestrial Census","content":"No one knows the exact number of Dragon-Blooded in Creation today. Approximate numbers follow: Dynasts: 10,000 Dynastic outcastes: 4,000 Cadet house members: 750 Patricians: 250 Prasadi: 2,000 Lookshyans: 3,000 Foreign outcastes: 5,000<br /> <br /> It does seem like that number of Dynastic outcastes is too high, whilst Cadet house is too small.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T01:24:17-07:00","id":1397637,"title":"","content":"I think the number of Dynastic outcastes is okay considering Creation is damn huge, so it allows to establish that there are many DB confederations and solitary agents all across the world. Cadet houses are only present in the Threshold (if I'm not mistaken) so I'm fine with their numbers being not too big.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T01:53:23-07:00","id":1397642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397637#post1397637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the number of Dynastic outcastes is okay considering Creation is damn huge, so it allows to establish that there are many DB confederations and solitary agents all across the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dynastic outcastes I assume refers to Outcastes in the Realm, not all over the world.<br /> <br /> Though tbh a lot probably are from Satrapies and were recruited into the Realm. Others were just born there because, well, frankly, a lot of Dragonblood get around.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T03:23:44-07:00","id":1397645,"title":"","content":"If you Exalt outside of the Dynasty, but on the Blessed Isle to a Patrician house, you are a Patrician.<br /> If you Exalted outside of the Dynasty, in a Threshold kingdom, ruled by Dragon-Blooded, but loyal to the Realm, AND sponsored by a Great House, then you belong to a Cadet House.<br /> If you Exalted outside of the Dynasty but are young and lucky enough to be adopted, you are a Dynast.<br /> <br /> Outcaste Dynasts encompasses EVERY OTHER Deeb who was not born into the Dynasty but is loyal to the Realm.<br /> <br /> Every bastard, every peasant byblow, every noble not directly sponsored by a Great House, every defector, any disposed or slave who draws the Second Breath, every village champion. If they join the Realm, that's their catagory. Otherwise their Foreign Outcastes.<br /> <br /> The Cadet Houses combined have three times the Dragons of the Patrician Houses. Almost enough Dragons to rival a Great House. I think the numbers work.<br /> <br /> But if they don't work for you, change them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T03:48:22-07:00","id":1397648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census#post1397629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It does seem like that number of Dynastic outcastes is too high</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are the outcastes of the Blessed Isle, one of the highest and most densely populated parts of Creation that has been ruled by a high concentration of Dragon Blooded for centuries. The dissemination of the Dragon's Blood can reasonably be assumed to crop up in 0.004% of the entire population.<br /> <br /> Also, there need to be enough outcastes for them to fulfil the military quota that has always been a big part of their place in the setting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">whilst Cadet house is too small.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you feel that Cadet Houses should be individually larger, or more numerous?<br /> <br /> The number of Cadet Houses is, I think, meant to give us a ballpark for how representative they are among governing bodies of the Threshold. I gather the intention is that rule outside of the Realm is not primarily a Dragon Blooded game, so you want those extra-Dynastic families to be present but not overwhelmingly so.<br /> <br /> It is also a thing that can be maintained logically. Great Houses can be large (and the smaller ones can experience reliable growth) because they can intermarry with one another to ensure strong bloodlines that reliably produce more Dragon Blooded. One has to presume that Cadet Houses struggle to maintain their current bloodline strength let alone increase it, because where exactly are they getting the well bred spouses from? It's not hard to extrapolate that any given Cadet Terrestrial has numerous mortal siblings, at least relative to Dynasts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T04:14:23-07:00","id":1397653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397648#post1397648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you feel that Cadet Houses should be individually larger, or more numerous?<br /> <br /> The number of Cadet Houses is, I think, meant to give us a ballpark for how representative they are among governing bodies of the Threshold. I gather the intention is that rule outside of the Realm is not primarily a Dragon Blooded game, so you want those extra-Dynastic families to be present but not overwhelmingly so.<br /> <br /> It is also a thing that can be maintained logically. Great Houses can be large (and the smaller ones can experience reliable growth) because they can intermarry with one another to ensure strong bloodlines that reliably produce more Dragon Blooded. One has to presume that Cadet Houses struggle to maintain their current bloodline strength let alone increase it, because where exactly are they getting the well bred spouses from? It's not hard to extrapolate that any given Cadet Terrestrial has numerous mortal siblings, at least relative to Dynasts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Individually larger. Since there are already several dozens of Cadet Houses. <br /> <br /> They can marriage with each other, or with the Dynasts and outcastes. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T04:26:53-07:00","id":1397659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census#post1397629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No one knows the exact number of Dragon-Blooded in Creation today. Approximate numbers follow: Dynasts: 10,000 Dynastic outcastes: 4,000 Cadet house members: 750 Patricians: 250 Prasadi: 2,000 Lookshyans: 3,000 Foreign outcastes: 5,000<br /> <br /> It does seem like that number of Dynastic outcastes is too high, whilst Cadet house is too small.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> then fiddle with the numbers. The 3E crew won't send Canon Enforcement Ninjas after you the way the 2E staff did <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 06-20-2020, 07:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T04:45:33-07:00","id":1397666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397653#post1397653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They can marriage with each other, or with the Dynasts and outcastes. </div> </div> </div> </div>How far away from House Ferah do you think the nearest other Cadet House is?<br /> <br /> Dynasts are included, probably integral, but they represent a significant step down on their part, so they can hardly be relied upon.<br /> <br /> Outcastes have insignificant bloodlines, including them probably often does more harm than good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T04:51:20-07:00","id":1397668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397666#post1397666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How far away from House Ferah do you think the nearest other Cadet House is?<br /> <br /> Dynasts are included, probably integral, but they represent a significant step down on their part, so they can hardly be relied upon.<br /> <br /> Outcastes have insignificant bloodlines, including them probably often does more harm than good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Distance is meaningless. Why is it mattered anyway? <br /> <br /> Dynasts <i>do </i>adopt and marriage with exceptional outcastes. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T04:54:50-07:00","id":1397670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397653#post1397653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Individually larger. Since there are already several dozens of Cadet Houses. <br /> <br /> They can marriage with each other, or with the Dynasts and outcastes. </div> </div> </div> </div>They're spread THOUSANDS of miles apart. Those born to Dynastic mothers are part of the Dynasty, not Cadet Houses. And attracting a male Dynast means making the Cadet House more appealing than marrying a Patrician or another Dynast. Attracting an Outcaste means stopping them going to the Realm to take the Razor or the Coin.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397668#post1397668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Distance is meaningless. Why is it mattered anyway?</div> </div> </div> </div>How likely are you to meet and marry someone thousands of miles away?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Dynasts <i>do </i>adopt and marriage with exceptional outcastes. </div> </div> </div>Agreed. Do you think they do it by the hundreds and thousands?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 06-20-2020, 07:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:01:01-07:00","id":1397672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397670#post1397670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How likely are you to meet and marry someone thousands of miles away?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragonblooded practice arranged marriage. They do not need to know and meet each other.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397670#post1397670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed. Do you think they do it by the hundreds and thousands?</div> </div> </div> </div>There are only 750 Cadet House DG, as opposed to Ten Thousand, and their bar is significantly lower than the Dynasts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:08:15-07:00","id":1397676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397672#post1397672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dragonblooded practice arranged marriage. They do not need to know and meet each other.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even so, the matchmakers would need to know each other.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There are only 750 Cadet House DG, as opposed to Ten Thousand, and their bar is significantly lower than the Dynasts. </div> </div> </div>Right. So, of those ten thousand Dynasts... what, one hundred? Two hundred? Will marry into Cadet Houses.<br /> <br /> Seems like enough to keep up a population of 750.<br /> <br /> Doesn't seem like enough to grow that number.<br /> <br /> Unless you are suggesting that hundreds and thousands of Dynasts are marrying into Cadet Houses, I don't see the basis of your complaint.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:18:22-07:00","id":1397682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397676#post1397676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even so, the matchmakers would need to know each other.</div> </div> </div> </div>Use Sorcery. Or Imperial Service. Or old-fashioned couriers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397676#post1397676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right. So, of those ten thousand Dynasts... what, one hundred? Two hundred? Will marry into Cadet Houses.<br /> <br /> Seems like enough to keep up a population of 750.<br /> <br /> Doesn't seem like enough to grow that number.<br /> <br /> Unless you are suggesting that hundreds and thousands of Dynasts are marrying into Cadet Houses, I don't see the basis of your complaint.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, 750 Cadet House Dragonblooded are too few to maintain hold of the Threshold. Even Prasad, a former Relam satrapy, boasts 2,000 DG. Considering sheer size and scope of the Threshold, there should be thousands of Cadet DG at the very least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:23:09-07:00","id":1397685,"title":"","content":"But even the couriers can only be sent somewhere if you know where you're sending them. You can't just look someone up on Facebook to marry. Or learn Sorcery from Youtube tutorials, for that matter. <br /> And the Threshold Cadet Houses get constantly drained of their Deebs by marriage, can barely attract Lost Eggs or other Outcastes, and have their power-base repeatedly annexed by the actual Dynastic Houses. I really fail to see the problem. 750 demigod heroes scattered over a bunch of families is still a lot.<br /> <br /> And how is Prasad a meaningful comparison? Prasad is a huge-ass Empire, that is also very far away and isolated enough to not just get drained of all it's Deebs because a) it's attractively big and stable itself, plus it is expanding, so there is wealth and land to go around and b) it's far away enough that it'll usually reach Lost Eggs around the Dreaming Sea first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:28:06-07:00","id":1397688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397682#post1397682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, 750 Cadet House Dragonblooded are too few to maintain hold of the Threshold. Even Prasad, a former Relam satrapy, boasts 2,000 DG. Considering sheer size and scope of the Threshold, there should be thousands of Cadet DG at the very least.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not the intended function of the cadet Houses in or out of character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:52:10-07:00","id":1397695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397682#post1397682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Use Sorcery. Or Imperial Service. Or old-fashioned couriers.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It is simple point and shoot. The satellites can shoot, but first they must be told where to point.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I mean, 750 Cadet House Dragonblooded are too few to maintain hold of the Threshold. Even Prasad, a former Relam satrapy, boasts 2,000 DG. Considering sheer size and scope of the Threshold, there should be thousands of Cadet DG at the very least. </div> </div> </div>Ah but the Cadet Houses DON'T maintain hold of the Threshold. Mortals (by and large) rule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T06:27:27-07:00","id":1397704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397695#post1397695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;It is simple point and shoot. The satellites can shoot, but first they must be told where to point.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Information is everything. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397695#post1397695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah but the Cadet Houses DON'T maintain hold of the Threshold. Mortals (by and large) rule.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah but it is the Dragonblooded hold dominion over the Threshold. They are both its rulers and defenders. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T06:30:25-07:00","id":1397707,"title":"","content":"BTW, doesn't the Realm proper enforce Razor or Coin to all Outcastes? I can easily imagine many Outcastes marry into the Cadet House to avoid the stark choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T06:42:23-07:00","id":1397710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397704#post1397704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah but it is the Dragonblooded hold dominion over the Threshold. They are both its rulers and defenders. </div> </div> </div> </div>Through the satrapy system, not the Cadet Houses.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397707#post1397707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BTW, doesn't the Realm proper enforce Razor or Coin to all Outcastes? I can easily imagine many Outcastes marry into the Cadet House to avoid the stark choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Realm does not possess nearly the resources to seek out all those outcastes. The Razor and the Coin is a choice primarily for Blessed Isle residents, and partially for satrapies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T11:37:39-07:00","id":1397779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397653#post1397653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Individually larger. Since there are already several dozens of Cadet Houses.</div> </div> </div> </div>To the best of my knowledge as a line developer, this has never been stated in published 3e material. The intention is that cadet houses appear in only a minority of satrapies. Cadet house status was a carrot held out for exemplary service and a tool to wield against the Great Houses, not a universal benefit for Threshold princes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397629-\u200ba-terrestrial-census?p=1397707#post1397707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BTW, doesn't the Realm proper enforce Razor or Coin to all Outcastes? I can easily imagine many Outcastes marry into the Cadet House to avoid the stark choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only those who Exalt on the Blessed Isle. The choice isn't offered to those who Exalt in the Threshold.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}